&lt;p&gt;For a side project, I converted DooM from C to C#. Having to deal with strange file types, alternative ways of (re)allocating memory, data structures being passed around as void* pointers and the likes, it&amp;rsquo;s tempting to use unsafe code in C#. Turns out, that&amp;rsquo;s not needed!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>